@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2D3748
    ActorBorderColor #2D3748
    LifeLineBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #A0AEC0
}

hide footbox
autonumber

control "Spring ApplicationEvent" as EventBus
control "RecruitmentEventListener" as Listener
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB
queue "RabbitMQ notify.email.q" as RabbitMQ
control "RealtimeNotificationService" as WebSocket

note over EventBus, WebSocket
  Event Fan-Out Architecture: Automatically dispatches domain events
  to In-App DB, Email Queue, and Realtime WebSocket simultaneously.
end note

== Fan-Out Recruitment Event Notification ==

EventBus -> Listener: Publish Event (e.g. CandidateAppliedEvent / InterviewScheduledEvent)
activate Listener
Listener -> Listener: TenantContext.setCurrentTenant(event.tenantId)

Listener -> TenantDB: INSERT notifications (In-App Notification record)
activate TenantDB
TenantDB --> Listener: Notification saved
deactivate TenantDB

par Parallel Channel Dispatch
  Listener -> RabbitMQ: publishEmail(EmailMessageDTO)
  activate RabbitMQ
  RabbitMQ --> Listener: Email queued
  deactivate RabbitMQ
else Realtime Push
  Listener -> WebSocket: pushNotificationToUser(recipientId, payload)
  activate WebSocket
  WebSocket --> Listener: STOMP frame pushed
  deactivate WebSocket
end

Listener -> Listener: TenantContext.clear()
deactivate Listener

@enduml
